      "message": "Suggest another CL adding \"pd_charge_from_device()\" logic as well.\nPD3.0 allows DiscID as UFP. This our \"Allow List\" mechanic, I believe.\n\nhttps://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/master/common/usb_pd_protocol.c#1523\nhttps://chromium.git.corp.google.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/master/common/usb_pd_dual_role.c#336\nhttps://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/2051217/3/common/usb_pd_policy.c\n\nCurrently contains only 2 Apple VID/PIDs for \"Apple Charge-Through Accessory\".\n(Likely needs to be rewritten at some point, per inline comments.)",
